Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 22:56:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1126/1178] The page in Greek; icon buttons follow a change of
 language (1166, part five)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- heresy-i18n-el.js: every key of the Russian catalog (2429), plural forms one/other; no word
  of the root δουλ- (Greek's own «раб»): λειτουργεί, ασχολείται, φινίρισμα instead.
- Chinese was made and called off (Viktor, 03.10.2026: «Отмена по китайской»): out of the page
  and out of the language list.
- HeresyIcons.dress() takes a button's words in English (RuachI18n.en, and the new
  RuachI18n.enAttr for its title): it runs after the translator's first pass, so a page loaded
  in another language pinned its icon buttons' tips and labels to that language when the
  language changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
